<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kimbyr has 5.34 percent of Underground.</title>
<headline>Kimbyr has 5.34 percent of Underground.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimbyr Investments Ltd has become a substantial security holder in New Zealand clothing retailer Underground Fashions Ltd with a relevant interest in 5.34 percent of its voting securities, Underground said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kimbyr, the New Zealand subsidiary of Just Jeans Holdings Ltd, is standing in the market for 28 percent of Underground's issued capital, or about 7.4 million shares.</p>
<p>Kimbyr is offering 33.5 NZ cents per Underground share. The offer closes on February 7.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
